  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORAD Rice Flour Production and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, CORAD is confident that it will create real benefits for the communities it serves. The idea behind this project is to develop a processing unit by ensuring that the necessary raw materials are available all year round, purchased from the union&apos;s member farmers at a fair price, and at the same time create value and wealth within the communities by facilitating the acquisition of land, irrigation systems and training in good farming techniques for 100 young farmers. Through this process, multiple benefits will be created, including new jobs, land acquisition opportunities for the new farmers and their families for multiple generations, good farming techniques, animal feed, capacity building in multiple areas, solutions to malnutrition, and increased income that will impact the quality of life for thousands of people.</narrative>
  </description>
